    ],
    "note": "<b>Friday is two events in one session.</b> A Bank of Japan hike to 1.25% is <b>97% priced</b>, on a carry position estimated at <b>$764bn to $1.1tn</b>, settling into the quarter's largest options expiry while dealer gamma is negative. The risk is not the hike \u2014 it is where the hedging flow goes when a widely-held funding trade and a quarterly roll land on the same afternoon."
